  "steps": [
    "In a blender, add chickpeas, onion, garlic, green chillies, coriander, salt, coriander powder, red chilli powder and cumin seeds.",
    "Blend in small portions without adding water to form a coarse, sticky mixture.",
    "Transfer to a bowl, add besan, baking soda and oil. Mix well.",
    "Shape into small falafels.",
    "Air fry in a preheated air fryer at 180°C for 20 minutes.",
    "Place falafels on a plate and top with curd mixture, green chutney, imli chutney, onions, coriander and sev."
  ],
